msgid "Gremsy Mio, Pixy, S1, T3, T7, and ZIO 3-Axis Gimbals"
msgstr "Gremsy Mio、Pixy、S1、T3、T7 和 ZIO 三轴云台"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gremsy-pixyu-gimbal.rst:7
#: 1b59aff163984117b7db04e1b2a47f43 71cd249cdb2e4e72ba0632d1f214d25c
#: 7c4f6ce4c7d8433c897c76b3ee9743c0 cddaea4ee45c4e11a641b5f5114e7c92
#: f913436b639f4ceebbb8b63ca3d147ad
msgid ""
"Gremsy `Mio <https://gremsy.com/products/mio>`__, `Pixy F "
"<https://gremsy.com/products/pixy-f>`__, `Pixy U "
"<https://gremsy.com/products/pixy-u>`__, `Pixy WP "
"<https://gremsy.com/products/pixy-wp>`__,  `S1 "
"<https://gremsy.com/products/gremsy-s1v3>`__, `T3 "
"<https://gremsy.com/products/gremsy-t3v3>`__, `T7 "
"<https://gremsy.com/products/gremsy-t7>`__ and `ZIO "
"<https://gremsy.com/zio>`__ 3-axis gimbals can communicate with the "
"autopilot using the MAVLink protocol and are compatible with a range of "
"cameras for real-time video or mapping purposes."
msgstr ""
"Gremsy `Mio <https://gremsy.com/products/mio>`__、`Pixy F "
"<https://gremsy.com/products/pixy-f>`__、`Pixy U "
"<https://gremsy.com/products/pixy-u>`__、`Pixy WP "
"<https://gremsy.com/products/pixy-wp>`__、`S1 "
"<https://gremsy.com/products/gremsy-s1v3>`__、`T3 "
"<https://gremsy.com/products/gremsy-t3v3>`__、`T7 "
"<https://gremsy.com/products/gremsy-t7>`__ 和 `ZIO "
"<https://gremsy.com/zio>`__ 三轴云台可通过 MAVLink 协议与飞控通信，兼容多种相机，适用于实时视频或测绘目的。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gremsy-pixyu-gimbal.rst:14
#: 659260f9c6024f5786d8269d4322e63a 6d22c1f9e3ff41b989fad2ec8447a960
#: c6278e53516a4fc4a3e7c7a09395f26c f115d392d65d4d1685b3e9f3a3323277
#: f2ba52a573a6435b8a8c5eb47fcbe9d3
msgid ""
"MIO gimbals are unable to communication with ArduPilot.  We hope for a fix "
"with Gremsy software version 7.7.3."
msgstr "MIO 云台无法与 ArduPilot 通信。期待 Gremsy 软件版本 7.7.3 修复此问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gremsy-pixyu-gimbal.rst:16
#: 2b18c853b121429ab442dbd709102cd2 4cc6f297ac664b85a249d4b2d8f0cbc7
#: 80f4675e14724375a33abfed14e5e094 84e15ba0fbcd450ab2dfef3ca917f021
#: 9446e082379d4a4ba6c498e74b4086ec
msgid "T3V3 gimbals must be running 7.7.3-Preview (or higher)."
msgstr "T3V3 云台必须运行 7.7.3-Preview（或更高版本）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gremsy-pixyu-gimbal.rst:18
#: 869f1cf3b7544a77971ce1771350ea6b 882e94eb3d3840e9aaf07406da46e793
#: 95f5882c33d14c65bfc4a08b0ace3307 a116ad168d0c4d9789de6f78044379af
#: fce339f21a9042df8729c942cf6958fc
msgid ""
"PixyU gimbals must be running 7.7.1 or 7.7.2.  7.7.3 does not work "
"correctly.  We hope for a fix with Gremsy version 7.7.4 (or higher)."
msgstr ""
"PixyU 云台必须运行 7.7.1 或 7.7.2。7.7.3 不能正常工作，期待 Gremsy 版本 7.7.4（或更高版本）修复此问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gremsy-pixyu-gimbal.rst:20
#: 0294c4299d174f7fb52c30da3e923014 0e8505fa59f94094bc2f1c14f4c8cd04
#: 4aa367ec48bf432196b5fb31ba05ff2c 66d7e093ebda45cfb824bbe524d37006
#: 7ca0551babe1429c84a6b51ac4f811a9
