"ZIO gimbals cannot be used as a secondary mount (e.g. \"Connecting Two "
"Gimbals\" below does not work with the ZIO)"
msgstr "ZIO 云台不能用作辅助挂载（例如，下方「连接两个云台」部分不适用于 ZIO）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gremsy-pixyu-gimbal.rst:25
#: 051cab42495e4e8d9b8bbf3ee7204919 0849155a27f246a68c9ea6c980e2da65
#: 3cf00a954c8a450585baf87f9541bf36 60a9fec3a77a446ebca1e632d37ed9c2
#: b39899404d454eaf8443d135b39c3b7d
msgid "Where to Buy"
msgstr "购买渠道"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gremsy-pixyu-gimbal.rst:27
#: 1c3640618b4b48ebb36a2a2187bd2008 326f33941cbc4e55ae022f545228ed55
