"These gimbals can be purchased from the `Gremsy store "
"<https://gremsy.com/online-store>`__"
msgstr "这些云台可从 `Gremsy 商店 <https://gremsy.com/online-store>`__ 购买"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gremsy-pixyu-gimbal.rst:30
#: 791753b7872143f096145e249a6cb1f2 81bac6d337cb4cd3aeebb60627144115
#: ad2a756138244003a7b5b29659e7553a d3602b13938b44dc97945fbd3ac34551
#: de45968d172e431094557cec2c28cd28
msgid "Connecting to the Autopilot"
msgstr "连接到飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gremsy-pixyu-gimbal.rst:36
#: 50a2010a51264b309d00367942a5ad2d b127ee7b58cf492fb5e8bdbb38cb5788
#: bd73871ea919447d920e854828dd6e31 c201d1c71222449599c8ac6e50fe7e21
#: e246e935d0034921b35041d6440333fe
msgid ""
"Connect the gimbals's COM2 port to one of the autopilot's Serial/Telemetry "
"ports like Telem2 as shown above."
msgstr "将云台的 COM2 口连接到飞控的串口/数传口（如上图所示的 Telem2）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gremsy-pixyu-gimbal.rst:38
#: 1208e1f378fa46ac82fa513994dc81e1 1522dc99f2b640eda02763096ab0ed2a
#: 15c79b7c3e36469cb1c118c5086f5772 1e58b4110dd24be5b243564b04ff0bd2
#: adc0c5eae0674a249c68975f411f9658
msgid ""
"Connect to the autopilot with a ground station and set the following "
"parameters, if using the first mount:"
msgstr "使用地面站连接到飞控，并设置以下参数（使用第一个挂载时）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-gremsy-pixyu-gimbal.rst:40
#: 0a32aa565333454b94ee73ba3863657b
msgid ":ref:`MNT1_TYPE <MNT1_TYPE>` to \"6\" for \"Gremsy\" and reboot the autopilot"
msgstr ":ref:`MNT1_TYPE <MNT1_TYPE>` 设置为「6」（Gremsy），然后重启飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gremsy-pixyu-gimbal.rst:41
#: d8228112ee4d4af69dae7bb028e910a2
msgid ""
"If using a ZIO with ArduPilot-4.5.0 (or higher) set :ref:`CAM1_TYPE "
"<CAM1_TYPE>` to \"6\" (MAVLinkCamV2) and reboot the autopilot"
msgstr ""
"若使用 ZIO 搭配 ArduPilot-4.5.0（或更高版本），将 :ref:`CAM1_TYPE <CAM1_TYPE>` "
"设置为「6」（MAVLinkCamV2）并重启飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gremsy-pixyu-gimbal.rst:42
#: 04eb7ff91d264ad281d95623ae9fed03 1596b0cc483f43a8a4cb9bcb02841501
#: 1700ba967862416d867590458ed6c4fa 408d3c9d502345cb9dfc0c859d6e31a7
#: d44fa7e300ef4d24b99fd3d6f75c06f2
msgid ""
":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` to \"115\" for 115200 bps.  \"SERIAL2\" "
"can be replaced with another serial port (i.e. SERIAL1) depending upon the "
"physical connection"
msgstr ""
":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` 设置为「115」（115200 "
"bps）。「SERIAL2」可根据实际连接替换为其他串口（如 SERIAL1）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gremsy-pixyu-gimbal.rst:43
#: 02294765a445470daeee27465fe25466 7e18436831eb41b29c23686d8e972a3b
#: 9caeec25ea314684b28276de02fe37bb c0323d5158d647398a0d19eeea721b12
#: cc59928058c44905ab5df39d0144f92f
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` to 2 for \"MAVLink2\""
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` 设置为 2（MAVLink2）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gremsy-pixyu-gimbal.rst:44
#: 13659fca364c4c39bafe8a34fae71ae2 4424e7635c80411eae75cb9b5edc3632
#: 50594254eafb4d7392b34d02602ab610 9bc153fffd8249879199296b1681fa0c
#: aa8b2eb875e8414bbb7c5ee86661fa6c
msgid ""
":ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS <SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` to 1024 for \"Don't forward mavlink"
" to/from\""
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS <SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` 设置为 1024（「不转发 MAVLink 至/自」）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gremsy-pixyu-gimbal.rst:46
#: 339eb1b0ec7247ccb199b056dd6196b3 3c4dc41249a34ac58ba7c06a4da2048e
#: 8edd2f91ad90408589a8a32dd0321924 97504d0747304fa0a0c9c36850ee3679
#: ecfff1439fe246d4a455e7c7081f7f5f
msgid ""
"See the \"Control with an RC transmitter\" section of :ref:`this page "
"<common-mount-targeting>` for details on parameter changes required to "
"control the gimbal through an RC Transmitter (aka \"RC Targeting\")"
msgstr ""
"参见 :ref:`此页面 <common-mount-targeting>` 的「通过RC遥控器控制」部分，了解通过RC遥控器（即「RC "
"Targeting」）控制云台所需的参数更改详情"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gremsy-pixyu-gimbal.rst:48
#: 2156d272492a46c3a0d57b039f898af7 53b8309368364ebab9ed291eacbcfadf
#: c3aa161daee049598c1b4e841d8f75fc c794532e5aec431a88a3277d73692465
#: ca30f9b4aee44b41af5a5f5d354a1827
msgid ""
"When the autopilot has successfully connected to the gimbal, \"Mount: GREMSY"
" PixyU fw:7.7.1.0\" (or similar) will be sent to the ground station.  "
"Looking for this message may be useful in determining if the autopilot and "
"gimbal are communicating successfully."
msgstr ""
"当飞控成功连接到云台后，会向地面站发送「Mount: GREMSY PixyU "
"fw:7.7.1.0」（或类似信息）。查找此消息有助于判断飞控与云台是否通信成功。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gremsy-pixyu-gimbal.rst:51
